<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>fall for me</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">WIMY</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">fall for me</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2HcuGRDpVK0yy8zRr1J2y4</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.493" end="00:35.040">And although</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.040" end="00:38.926">I've waited this long for</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.926" end="00:43.331">You to come forward</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.331" end="00:46.954">With how you're feeling 'bout me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.954" end="00:51.125">While you're over</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.125" end="00:54.860">Wish we could be closer</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.860" end="00:59.285">I'm losing composure</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.285" end="01:03.888">But I can't see my life without you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.888" end="01:05.774">We're moving pretty slow</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.774" end="01:07.398">What's the point in that?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.398" end="01:09.635">You think that's there's something I don't know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.635" end="01:11.135">Think I'm still attached</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.134" end="01:14.821">I'm stuck in the motion</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.821" end="01:20.057">But I could still hold on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.057" end="01:21.729">Fall for me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.729" end="01:23.445">I'd fall for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.445" end="01:25.521">Why don't you fall for me?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.521" end="01:27.218">I'll fall for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.218" end="01:30.973">I want you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.973" end="01:35.947">Baby I want you to</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.947" end="01:37.595">Fall for me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.595" end="01:39.445">I'd fall for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.445" end="01:41.484">Why don't you fall for me?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.484" end="01:43.285">I'll fall for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.285" end="01:46.977">I want you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.977" end="01:52.910">Baby I want you to</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.910" end="01:56.552">The thought of you waking up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.552" end="02:01.127">Next to me with your makeup on my cheek</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.127" end="02:03.448" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Up on my cheek)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.448" end="02:06.447">And I wish that it weren't just</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.447" end="02:09.084">That same old dream</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.084" end="02:12.252">I think I've run out of luck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.252" end="02:14.376">You're the puzzle and</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.376" end="02:16.791">I am stuck it seems</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.791" end="02:19.499" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I'm stuck it seem)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.499" end="02:24.252">Can't you see that it might just be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.252" end="02:25.752">We're moving pretty slow</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.626" end="02:27.222">What's the point in that?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.222" end="02:29.532">You think that's there's something I don't know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.532" end="02:31.032">Think I'm still attached</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.026" end="02:34.847">I'm stuck in the motion</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.847" end="02:40.014">But I could still hold on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.014" end="02:41.561">Fall for me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.561" end="02:43.419">I'd fall for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:43.419" end="02:45.515">Why don't you fall for me?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.515" end="02:47.240">I'll fall for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.240" end="02:50.871">I want you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:50.871" end="02:55.929">Baby I want you to</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:55.929" end="02:57.468">Fall for me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:57.468" end="02:59.241">I'd fall for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:59.241" end="03:01.424">Why don't you fall for me?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:01.424" end="03:03.308">I'll fall for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:03.308" end="03:07.233">I want you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:07.233" end="03:11.233">Baby I want you to</p></div></body></tt>